id: pm-jira-jszx
title: Pilot pm-github issue sync for pm-jira
description: Pilot installation and scheduled pull request synchronization for the package GitHub issue tracker; preserve existing pm records and verify no duplicates.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T20:06:54.839Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-28T20:40:40.321Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-28T20:40:39.755Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-28T20:40:39.755Z"
author: pi-agent
resolution: Scheduled project-scoped pm-github sync is installed and opens or updates a PR from a branch.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-28T20:16:28.432Z",pi-agent,"The GitHub issue diff was empty: gh issue list returned no issues. The dry-run and real atomic import both planned and applied 0 new items and 0 updates; there was nothing to link or create."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-28T20:16:29.517Z",pi-agent,"The first documented install attempt failed under pinned pm 2026.8.22 because npm 12 emits object-shaped npm pack JSON and the installer treated the final } as a tarball name. Pinning @unbrained/pm-cli to 2026.8.28 did not remove the npm-client mismatch, so the verified install uses a temporary npm 10.9.3 path. The published pm-github 2026.8.18 manifest also carried an obsolete pm key and floor 2026.8.3; the workflow removes that key and restores the source floor 2026.8.20 before strict health."
files[6]{path,scope,note}:
  .agents/pm/extensions/.managed-extensions.json,project,Declare pm-github as a project-scoped managed extension.
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project,CI installs and normalizes the project pm-github extension before health.
  .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project,Scheduled import runs on automation/pm-github-sync and opens or updates a PR.
  .gitignore,project,Track the managed project extension registry while ignoring extracted artifacts.
  package-lock.json,project,Lock the verified pm CLI version.
  package.json,project,Pin the pm CLI used by the integration.
tests[2]{command,path,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref},note}:
  ./node_modules/.bin/pm github import unbraind/pm-jira --state all --atomic --dry-run,.github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-28T20:16:31.667Z",local_mutation,fix/refuse-unattested-publish-fallback,Dry-run must report 0 creates and 0 updates.
  ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit,.github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-28T20:16:31.667Z",local_mutation,fix/refuse-unattested-publish-fallback,Strict health verdict used by the sync workflow.
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  README.md,project,Package documentation context for project-scoped pm installation.
close_reason: "Pilot verified: GitHub issue list was empty, the atomic dry-run and real import both planned and applied 0 creates and 0 updates, duplicates remained at zero, YAML and shell checks passed, and npm run release:check plus ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit passed."
